{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/c5792e9b813d83d15e75e3e4f625c1af.avif?t=1761588082\" width=616 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/e4278f9e4e3643bb583711ec36406c7b.poster.avif?t=1761588082\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/e4278f9e4e3643bb583711ec36406c7b.webm?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/e4278f9e4e3643bb583711ec36406c7b.mp4?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to your first week working at The E.I.D.O.L.O.N. Institute, an organisation founded to combat the growing number of haunted objects created from the cataclysm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's your job to use the provided tools around you to uncover clues. Try holding the object under a UV Blacklight, scanning the EMF Rating, or just smacking it with a Silver Hammer to see if it does anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/24100f7e5ce2003b5b78f7cf8c317d1a.avif?t=1761588082\" width=616 height=31 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.poster.avif?t=1761588082\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.webm?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.mp4?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark the results on your clipboard to figure out what is haunting your object and correctly send them down the chute to progress through your shifts.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/3b7dd392e594da1c8fbeb7f984e86ddd.avif?t=1761588082\" width=616 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.poster.avif?t=1761588082\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.webm?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.mp4?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job does come with a slight risk... Rumour has it that the more time you spend working at the institute, the more your mind will lose sight of what is real. Fend off your hallucinations and hold onto reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it to the end of the week without getting fired or going insane, and you might get yourself a pretty paycheck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INCREASED ITEMS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/ab23511da73f196abdcab59eadc2fb2f.poster.avif?t=1761588082\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/ab23511da73f196abdcab59eadc2fb2f.webm?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/ab23511da73f196abdcab59eadc2fb2f.mp4?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW 'OVERTIME' MODE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Introducing the new 'Overtime' Mode, a highscore based challenge that presents you with new faces, upgrades, and items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/d2dcf5ced3243462166fed5af3b034b3.poster.avif?t=1761588082\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/d2dcf5ced3243462166fed5af3b034b3.webm?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/d2dcf5ced3243462166fed5af3b034b3.mp4?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/f7faec8dd1465f1e623859b1472908b9.poster.avif?t=1761588082\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/f7faec8dd1465f1e623859b1472908b9.webm?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati