mer to see if it does anything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/24100f7e5ce2003b5b78f7cf8c317d1a.avif?t=1761588082\" width=616 height=31 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.poster.avif?t=1761588082\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.webm?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/abdcddabf39ab2b05b22da915dac6af0.mp4?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mark the results on your clipboard to figure out what is haunting your object and correctly send them down the chute to progress through your shifts.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/3b7dd392e594da1c8fbeb7f984e86ddd.avif?t=1761588082\" width=616 height=31 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.poster.avif?t=1761588082\" width=610 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5f5d94f30a5197df45.webm?t=1761588082\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669400/extras/fe8121b929157d5